==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*8 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Kenshin Himura (Enemy)|Kenshin Himura]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

